              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ncobeni ndaita inzubo zyoonse zyazisi zyakunyika, mbwaamba Jehova, nkabela bayoosika, bayookazika umwi aumwi cuuno cakwe cabwami kumanjililo aamilyango ya-Jerusalemu, akuzyungulusya malambo aawo oonse, akuminzi yoonse yacisi ca-Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
