        },
        {
          "text": "Bona! Buzuba obuno ndakubika kuti ube munzi uuli alubaya, munsende wabutale, malambo aamundalila, kunyika yoonse, kubami bacisi ca-Juda abasilutwe baco abapaizi baco abantu boonse banyika. ",
